    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Отлично.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let us examine the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Что же это такое?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is this?' When Elena accidentally bumps a diner, the guest exclaims in annoyance.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "guest",
      "t": "Что у вас за ресторан?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What kind of restaurant is this?' The upset customer complains about what kind of restaurant is being run here.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Простите, я не хотела.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm sorry, I didn't mean to.' Elena quickly apologizes and explains it was an accident. Chef Viktor answers straight away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Какие планы на вечер?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Any plans for tonight?' Stepping in smoothly, Barinov changes the subject and asks Elena what her plans are for tonight.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "У меня никаких.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't have any.' Still flustered, Elena admits she has no plans at all.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "А что, есть варианты?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Got something in mind?' Catching his tone, she asks if he has a suggestion in mind. Then Chef Viktor replies.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вариант один.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'One thing.' Viktor says he has one great option.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Но нужно быть вдвоём.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But it takes two.' He hints playfully that his plan requires the two of them together.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Какой тонкий намёк.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What a subtle hint.' Elena smiles and teases him for such a 'subtle' hint.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Я хотела поехать за покупками.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I wanted to go shopping.' She says she had been thinking of going shopping after work.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Но твой вариант мне нравится.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But I like your idea.' However, she admits she likes Viktor's idea much better.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Отлично.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excellent.' Delighted that she said yes to a date, Viktor replies 'excellent'. Now let us listen to the conversation once again.",
